    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Suite \u00e0 un accident, Pierre la soixantaine, se retrouve clou\u00e9 au lit avec une jambe dans le pl\u00e2tre. Misanthrope au caract\u00e8re bien tremp\u00e9 r\u00eavant de silence et de solitude, voil\u00e0 que le monde s\u2019invite \u00e0 son chevet. Il assiste alors impuissant \u00e0 la valse quotidienne des m\u00e9decins, infirmi\u00e8res et personnels hospitalier, puis de ses proches dont son fr\u00e8re Herv\u00e9. Au fil de rencontres inattendues, dr\u00f4les ou touchantes, Pierre reconsid\u00e8re certains a priori et pose sur les autres un regard diff\u00e9rent. Et, contre toute attente, ce s\u00e9jour \u00e0 l\u2019h\u00f4pital finit par ressembler \u00e0 une renaissance\u2026",
        "english": "After an accident, Pierre, in his sixties, finds himself stuck in bed with a leg in plaster. A misanthrope with a strong personality dreaming of silence and solitude, he now finds himself surrounded by people. He's powerless to stop the daily waltz of doctors, nurses, hospital staff, and his nearest and dearest, including his brother Herv\u00e9, who cluster at his bedside. These encounters, some amusing, some moving, make Pierre reconsider some of his prejudices and make him look at other people in a different way. Against all expectations, his stay in the hospital ends up being a kind of rebirth..."
    },
